      "narrative": "Darjeeling's first day blends panoramic viewpoints like Gombu Rock with cultural stops at Deshbandu Museum and Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, followed by leisure at Nightingale Park and the bustling Mall Road, offering a mix of sightseeing and local atmosphere."
